Array
0 1 2 3 4 5 6
* indexed is used to access random elements
* index are adjacent. increase to go ahead , decrease to go to previous.
* size is limited
* you can get index out of bound exception for invalid values

Stack
6 <- top
5
4
3
2
1
0
* random element access is not possible
* element are added / removed from top
* it is a LIFO [Last in first out] structure


Queue
0 1 2 3 4 5 6
f           r

* queue is FIFO[First in first out]

q with fixed size
    /*
    * 0 1 2
    *   1 2 3
    *     3 4 5
    *       4 5 6
    *         5 6 7
    * */



